{
  "candidateCarrier": {
    "default": "runtime"
  },
  "description": "使用现有 Runtime 的原 update target 修改 enabled、renderMode 或已公开的 content 文本；initialValue须为观察中的当前值。保留实例身份与未改字段。速度等源码参数使用 runtime.source。",
  "examples": [
    {
      "bindings": "values 的 initialValue/value 来自当前观察、已读资源或用户要求，值须满足本卡 inputSchema；destination 原样复制当前目标。",
      "code": "const input={\"field\":\"enabled\",\"initialValue\":values[\"initialValue\"],\"value\":values[\"value\"]}; const receipt=await session.execute(\"runtime.configure\",input,destination);"
    },
    {
      "bindings": "values 的 initialValue/value 来自当前观察、已读资源或用户要求，值须满足本卡 inputSchema；destination 原样复制当前目标。",
      "code": "const input={\"field\":\"renderMode\",\"initialValue\":values[\"initialValue\"],\"value\":values[\"value\"]}; const receipt=await session.execute(\"runtime.configure\",input,destination);"
    },
    {
      "bindings": "values 的 contentKey/initialValue/value 来自当前观察、已读资源或用户要求，值须满足本卡 inputSchema；destination 原样复制当前目标。",
      "code": "const input={\"field\":\"content\",\"contentKey\":values[\"contentKey\"],\"initialValue\":values[\"initialValue\"],\"value\":values[\"value\"]}; const receipt=await session.execute(\"runtime.configure\",input,destination);"
    }
  ],
  "inputSchema": {
    "$defs": {
      "__schema0": {
        "enum": [
          "dom",
          "phaser",
          "hybrid"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "oneOf": [
      {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "field": {
            "const": "enabled",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "initialValue": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "value": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "field",
          "initialValue",
          "value"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "field": {
            "const": "renderMode",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "initialValue": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema0"
          },
          "value": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema0"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "field",
          "initialValue",
          "value"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "contentKey": {
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "field": {
            "const": "content",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "initialValue": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "value": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "field",
          "contentKey",
          "initialValue",
          "value"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      }
    ]
  },
  "invocation": "Builder: await session.execute(tool,input,destination)。input 遵循本卡完整 Schema；destination 原样使用当前 observe/createScope 的目标；只以 committed receipt 判定成功。",
  "name": "runtime.configure",
  "recovery": "invalid-input: 按本卡 Schema 修正字段；revision-conflict: 重新 observe 后复制新 target 和源码基线；tool-failed: 读取 diagnostics 修复所指输入/资源/宿主条件，失败不代表已提交。",
  "support": "conditional-on-input-target-resources-and-host",
  "supportedScopes": [
    "slide:scene",
    "slide:global",
    "flow:surface"
  ],
  "variants": [
    {
      "scopes": [
        "slide:scene",
        "slide:global",
        "flow:surface"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "version": 1
}
